## Code Example

```pseudo
structure Slot { payload; header; seq; }
function Enqueue(buf, item): void {
  Slot s = select_next_slot();
  s.payload = item;
  s.header = make_header(++tail_seq);
  persist(s.header); // clwb/flushopt + sfence
  fence();
  tail = tail + 1; // release store
}
function Dequeue(): Item {
  if (head == tail) return EMPTY;
  Item it = read_slot(head);
  head = head + 1; // release
  persist(head);
  return it;
}
```

